==Strategy==
THE SLOTH has a massive health pool and extremely strong attacks, but do not fret. Due to his high range and slow attacks, he is very easy to stall by having a consistent line of small meatshields like [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]]. Fast-moving cats, such as [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] and [[Swimmer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Butterfly Cat]], can be used to squeeze in hits on THE SLOTH without any precise timing required. If you are using Giraffe Cat, be sure to watch your money closely as spamming him will quickly drain your cash.

The supporting peons, however, require proper meatshielding to counter. [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] does not work well on this stage because of his slow speed and tendency to target peons instead of THE SLOTH. [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] can deal with the peons, however, any attackers inside of THE SLOTH's attacking range are guaranteed to die. If you own any [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]] that outrange THE SLOTH, be sure to use them as they will speed up this stage considerably.

